// ─── prisma\fragments\ticket.prisma ───
// Ticket — the unit of work. `ownerId` keeps the spec's frozen field name
// even though `assertOwnership` compares a literal `userId` (plan finding
// F6); the adaptation lives in one helper, `assertTicketOwnership` in
// `src/lib/tickets.ts`, and nowhere else.
//
// `priority`, `category` and `sentiment` are nullable because AI triage
// fills them and AI is an enhancement, never a gate: when the provider is
// unavailable the ticket is still created, unclassified.
